HLE sceCdReadDvdDualInfo: detect a dual-layer image by the second ISO volume
descriptor at the first volume size; layer 1 starts 16 sectors before it.
Without a handler the analyzer kept the guest version, which waits forever to
bind the CDVD S-command server (0x80000593) that only the BIOS provides.

